DEGS
====

DEGS is a Dynamic Experience Graph for Skills implementation. The repository
contains the method, its SpreadsheetBench execution adapters, tests, and
reproduction documentation. Historical experimental implementations and run
artifacts are not part of the supported runtime.

Python and system dependencies such as NetworkX, OpenAI's Python library,
openpyxl, LibreOffice, and bubblewrap are not bundled. They retain their own
licenses and notices.
